   "text": "University of Waikato - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Waikato - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Waikato is a comprehensive university in Hamilton, New Zealand and was established in 1964. In the latest 2021 QS rankings, The University of Waikato leapt more than 30 places in six years to 370th place – in the top five percent of the world's 26,000 universities.\nThe foundation program offers guaranteed entry to most University of Waikato undergraduate degrees upon successful completion and is recognized by all New Zealand universities. The program is taught on the University of Waikato main campus so students have access to all services and facilities.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:26\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:43\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nNew Zealand\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$23,000.00\nMin: US$11,500.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n20%\n2,520 of 12,600 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1964\nCampus(es)\nHamilton\nCountry\nNew Zealand\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sGrcky6hVnw\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
